# Connector catalogue captured from a CUSTOMER environment. Mostly Microsoft public
# catalogue, but it also names their CUSTOM connectors, which are business-identifying
# ("Get CRM objects from Hubspot"). Customer data does not go in git -- see
# .claude/rules/security-rules.md "Handling customer data".
docs/connector-api-index.json

# Ad-hoc probe output left in server/ by the _probe_*/_diag_* spikes. Same rule as the
# connector catalogue above: these name the customer's AGENTS and carry their Dataverse
# GUIDs and deployed agent-engine ids, which is customer data. `de.json` is a 2.2MB
# Discovery Engine spec dump -- a generated vendor artifact, re-fetchable, not source.
server/agents_hub.txt
server/bots.txt
server/mcp_inv.txt
server/re_inv.txt
server/re_now.txt
server/de.json
